{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいっぱい学んだ日でした。\nうん。難しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日近所を散歩してたんですが、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい撮ってしまいました。\nブログの始まりに苔って...\nて思った方すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんぐりさんもおられるぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この苔を原っぱとして、\nちっちゃい羊や牛の人形を並べたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋服ってどこから決めていく？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着たいと思ったものから\n決めてくよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートよりパンツ派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニスカとかあんま履かない...\nパンツとワンピースが多いかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーリッシィもサボンも\nかわいいよね！アイアムアイも好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきよ～かわいいよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりおくんに大好きって\n伝えてもらえますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え！ほんと！？うそじゃない？！\nメンバーにはバカにされたから←\n女の子が言ってくれるのは\n相当嬉しい..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふんがふんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カキフライには醤油派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみには申し訳ないんだが、\n私は貝類が苦手なんだ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近みた映画ありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「重力ピエロ」\n友達に借りた！\nあの雰囲気だいすきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋にアロマキャンドル置いてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置いてるけど最近\nそんなつけてない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のテストの出来はどうだった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「なかいさん」改め\n「まりひめさん」っていう\n新ユニット名はどうかな?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビ名ね！\n断然まりひめの方がかわいいよね！笑\nちょっとひめかに相談してみるわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンタクトしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つけてないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「13日の金曜日」の呼び方って\nありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は13日って呼んでる。\n13金でも良いかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーカーとシャツとカーディガン\nならどれが好き？\n自分が着るならと男が着るならで！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部すき！\nシャツ+パーカー\nシャツ+カーディガンでも良いよね。\nしいて言うならどっちもシャツ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春に男性にどんな服装してほしい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春だし明るい方がいいかなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リュック派?トート派?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はトート派"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人暮らし？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実家です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分はどんな子だと思いますか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はしゃぐときははしゃぐ。\n静かなときは静か。飽きっぽい。\nいろんな意味でかなり\nめんどくさい人だと自分で思う。\nいろいろこだわり過ぎて\nモテないタイプ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"侍ジャパンのがうっちシーン\n見たことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たことない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人中ビームって握手会でお願い\nしたらやってくれんの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の握手会で何度かお願いされて\nやったけど反応に困ってたよう\nだったので、しません←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかのHTCJの色は何色？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まりかと言わない松村さん。\nやっぱり寂しい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日会ったよ♪\nさゆりんはDDだからしゃーない...\nうん。ちょっとだけね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのアプリで落書きしてるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スケッチ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛さの秘訣ってなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと可愛い、きれいって\n言ってもらえるようにがんばる！\n↑「がんばる！」...これです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな料理って何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は和食にこってて...\n焼き魚...和食のおかず...鍋すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうのがあったらいいな～って\n大まかなイメージをもって買物に\n行く派？それとも直感で買う派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく行くときもあるし、\nほしいもの買いに行くときもあるし...\nどっちもあります！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで読んでると女の子が\n服のこと褒めてくれたり\n参考にしてます！って\n言ってくれたり...とても嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おにゃのこ♪おにゃのこ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/09/4027518/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりお前髪あるver."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の眉毛触ってみろ！\nわっさわっさしてっぞ！\n女の子だいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりお"}],"source":"archive"}